    "text_232435774_copy__843545249": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:title": "1",
      "cq:masterBuildingBlock": true,
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 23 2021 20:35:55 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 24 2021 15:45:04 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "cq/experience-fragments/editor/components/buildingblock",
      "text_232435774_copy__84354524910877490750216360": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Practicing her passion</span></span></p>\n<p>After surgery, as Jillian faced long hours of physical therapy and cancer treatments, she started thinking about how she could be active again. She thought about taking up a new sport like skeet shooting, but her mind kept going back to volleyball, so she decided to teach herself how to play sitting volleyball. “I started practicing by myself, and as I became stronger, I decided to record a video and send it to the U.S. national sitting volleyball team.” To Jillian’s surprise, she was asked to join the program and start training with the team after completing her treatments.</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 26 2021 15:44:37 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true",
