    "text_232435774_copy__497739052": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:title": "2",
      "cq:masterBuildingBlock": true,
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 23 2021 20:35:55 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 24 2021 15:45:39 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "cq/experience-fragments/editor/components/buildingblock",
      "text_232435774_copy__49773905210877525081619623": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bottomPadding": "4",
        "leftPadding": "6",
        "topPadding": "6",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
        "hideComponent": "false",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">It wasn’t long before Jillian discovered another passion and motivation—helping people. As a Mako Product Specialist, Jillian connects with patients and surgeons in a unique way. </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">“I feel like I do my job 10 times better,”</span></span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"> she says, crediting her personal experience. “Over the years I have encountered more doctors than I ever wish to say. </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">I feel like </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">I’m able to empathize with surgeons and see why they chose orthopaedics as a specialty, to help patients like me.</span></span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"> I love supporting doctors and their patients so much and having the best product on the market helps.”</span></span></span></p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 24 2021 16:03:44 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
        "rightPadding": "6",
        "backgroundColor": "rgba(84,88,87,1)",
        "textIsRich": "true",
        "cq:responsive": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "default": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "offset": "0",
            "width": "10"
          },
          "phone": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "width": "12"
          }
        }
      },
      "text_232435774_copy": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
        "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 23 2021 20:35:55 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Routinely, Jillian sits and empathizes with a patient in fear, comforting them before major surgery. “It makes me feel fulfilled,” she says. Every day, Stryker’s values are lived through Jillian—including accountability for patients and a determination for better outcomes.<br>\n</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 24 2021 15:38:43 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true",
