      "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 23 2021 20:40:19 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>Keep Reading: <a href=\"https://www.strykercareersblog.com/post/life-after-the-olympics\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Life after the Olympics</span></a><br>\n</p>\n",
